{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_title", "source_sha256": "61f8d9d1c561a809dcdb2786f729194cee82f6a789b5768bf77ef409d3f4b528", "ja": "密やかな本音", "zh": "暗藏的心声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1cd01564d454d6941ef5bba5a61020e01997664c0fcdef9ececa4ecc7603c3a9", "ja": "選挙活動が始まっても生徒会室にいる茜。\n姉の紗代子はお小言を言い、何故副会長と\n会計の両方に立候補したかを問う。窓の外に\n元気がない様子の環を見つけた茜は、紗代子\nに断って、話しかけにいく。", "zh": "即使选举活动开始了，茜依然待在学生会室里。\n姐姐纱代子训斥了她，并问她为什么同时竞选副会长和会计。茜发现窗外的环看起来无精打采，便向纱代子打了声招呼，过去和她说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1000_047sub", "source_sha256": "f719d3ae8448308c2447ea79e7591d33b3f759b136fd81debd6a9105fed76403", "ja": "その後、恵美さんが副会長。\n高坂さんが生徒会長に立候補した。", "zh": "在那之后，惠美学姐参选副会长，\n高坂学姐参选了学生会长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "b968f48adb611481d75acbb9f0dba29a013c670b397c0d1f20db419ded627ec6", "ja": "数日後、全ての立候補者が公示され、\nいよいよミリオン女学園の生徒会選挙が始まった……", "zh": "几天后，所有的候选人都已公布，\n百万女学园的学生会选举终于拉开了帷幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "ff6bdd84c5d4021173a803e515f3db04beda15442ba8e63458051ec35b9e0755", "ja": "選挙に一番乗りで立候補しておいて、こんな\nところで油を売っているなんて……大丈夫なの？", "zh": "明明第一个报名参加选举，却在这种地方磨蹭……没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "057f69efe95c97a70ee2ded21e587d0d4bee474a7eafca1641804d3d92c8f220", "ja": "副会長選、恵美さんは手強いわよ。", "zh": "副会长选举，惠美可不好对付哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "9d0e51d3997b9027a476429a6972c905cbb906b2aa22738021fdee85a9d94557", "ja": "……。お姉さまは心配性なのか、それとも\nサディスティックなご趣味をお持ちなのか……。", "zh": "……。姐姐大人到底是爱操心呢，\n还是有着什么施虐狂的特殊趣味呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "49fb08d93e1c7ca1a7abdf86fb6ca9adbeab040de3b2e2cb5bada7743e5e6088", "ja": "恵美ちゃんの背中を押したのは\nお姉さまだって事くらい、わかってますから。", "zh": "推了恵美一把的人是姐姐大人，\n这点事茜还是看得出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "e3900c893778c73c9a66e334e38ea0b9f61f57afcb8c25c0e2b71db410ec47fc", "ja": "それは……適材適所っていうでしょ。恵美さんは\n副会長、茜は会計。それがベストだと思ってるわ。", "zh": "那是……所谓的因材适用吧。惠美负责副会长，茜负责会计。我觉得这样才是最合适的安排。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "9b14e57411a69447994f341e617603afed883607cf0ea400b115daa4db5a96ec", "ja": "そうですわね。まあたしかに、\n会計は私にピッタリだとは思いますけど……。", "zh": "确实是这样呢。嗯，我也觉得，会计这个职位确实很适合我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "01e3de024de10723f8a957416b81cecf11b041494aff9264fe3c2f8457fa33b4", "ja": "今回は会計の候補者がいなかったので、\n副会長とWで立候補してますし。", "zh": "这次因为没有人竞选会计，所以我和副会长一起报名参选了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "e27a8933e2549c7e2da14250c4f558b2fd2b4ce95dc116dcb15215e4dc8f4264", "ja": "それ、気になってたんだけど。どうして\n最初から、会計一本に絞らなかったの？", "zh": "这个我一直有点在意。为什么一开始不只竞选会计呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "cd915b8bda125dba4e6c7eca74fc3e6ca9bcefdee5c9c792647c2e2c710b936e", "ja": "だって。決められたレール通りに行くのは、\n面白くないでしょう？", "zh": "因为嘛，按既定的轨道走，一点意思都没有，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "6460d943103065cd52b4e41929774f2454a9d709d3255f63ae5b9043ddf5091f", "ja": "……ふふっ。\nやっぱり似てない姉妹だね、私たちは。", "zh": "……呵呵。\n我们这对姐妹，果然一点也不像呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "8379d29e990311b193f9510e77a5f3153ca74aed5a59f9e78bc6bf3896652f71", "ja": "そうですわね。……だから、\nせめて副会長がよかったんですけど。", "zh": "是这样呢……所以，至少让我当个副会长也好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "90cefc0ddd612e368c99dc44048b3b973b5f68c5fc69f12c3b37475fa4426d31", "ja": "？　何か言った？", "zh": "？你刚才说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "c1da7da046563aa8c62b02093a50b19f35558e880306403e976d9267a7e0a79f", "ja": "いいえ、別に。……ん？\nあそこにいるのは、千早さんにお熱な環ちゃんか。", "zh": "没有，没什么。……嗯？\n在那里的是那个迷恋千早的环吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "cecef46beba520d86531df9c2e933665d3e2de51be2e6ccf7651c90069c5f48e", "ja": "ああ、聖歌隊の。\nでも、なんだか元気がないように見えるわね……？", "zh": "啊，是唱诗班的孩子。\n不过，总觉得她看起来没什么精神……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "04d43fab162a5fb50789d04598a00adb0df98282f4a8de7ffadeb09d4c7ee57c", "ja": "……。\nお姉さま、私ちょっと出てきます！", "zh": "……  \n姐姐大人，我出去一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "0e387fca4914e1a70f3865c8d3b4daad89a7bb5471a0b9955a92d40f95dc39fc", "ja": "へえ……。\nあの子が、下級生をかまうなんて。", "zh": "哦……。\n她居然会关照低年级生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "15626c66d017c682b6c5bf5d50b826b0eeccd73db345d0dbe65685552963fd50", "ja": "ごきげんよう、環ちゃん。\nどうかしたの？", "zh": "早上好，环。\n怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "04c45933cdca379ac607d270839d010d2a5273ee002ebaece08881a03b4242cb", "ja": "……。\n先輩は、いつも機嫌良さそうですね。", "zh": "……\n前辈看起来心情总很好的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "87d61685a5f091a097b0793cafff78f7e41157f13a22c4ac831a74364664a3df", "ja": "うにゃ？", "zh": "呜喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "71c6757e8086043338dbbcf7115f0c5a0d114b978681cad99b2576399c9f7ec8", "ja": "……今日は千早さんが、ひとりだったんです。\nお姉さまとも、妹のあの子とも一緒にいなくて。", "zh": "……今天千早姐是一个人待着的。\n既没有跟姐姐大人在一起，也没有跟妹妹那个孩子在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "d27f42fc24ea67bae8b7f98a0184aa69800a41f0b2cd975b7d525a65298dcf7f", "ja": "あの子っていうのは、昴ちゃんのこと？\nほうほう、それはチャンスだね。", "zh": "你说的那个孩子，是昴吗？\n哦哦，这可是个机会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "34c2cfdf6e47bda5533bfc317b0de9e405d3de9f0a77f0135a09b7528978ac9f", "ja": "ボクもそう思って話しかけたんです。\n歌のこととか、色々聞いたりして。", "zh": "我也是这么想的，所以就去搭话了。\n还问了她一些关于唱歌之类的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "d377cc226774bdc3be9e2fd602be70795f49dc32fa13e78205db47991c59f21d", "ja": "そしたら、「今はひとりにしてほしい」って\n言われちゃって……。", "zh": "结果却被说：“现在想一个人待着。”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "62f083fd4f9d70e7ad09c819f85196aed38adc48f234093a82862af02e28d4ee", "ja": "そっかぁ。わかるよ。環ちゃんは、\n千早さんに元気出してほしかったんだよね。", "zh": "这样啊。我明白的。环是希望千早\n打起精神来，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "b744e47b166f448dcd6971fcfd9c0b6df40eaaa29cd1fbf825411f6541b4765b", "ja": "あと、あわよくば\n妹になれるチャンスかもって思ったんだよね。", "zh": "还有，你心里其实在想，\n说不定能借机当上她的妹妹对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "f01914ac1caab727786fc2ec3e8c2c67423de067cd7ac40d99ed4e40380ae78d", "ja": "先輩、一言多いです。", "zh": "前辈，你这话多余了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_08_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_08_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "d77162d3750ddd1c54ab97959769438c1d92f12759d6149fa6a1dca66738c94b", "ja": "にゃは。", "zh": "呀哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
